Chips help people enter information, make selections, filter content, or trigger actions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"suggestion chip","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is a compact UI element used to present recommended or predictive options based on user input or context.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This version of the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"suggestion chip","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" uses the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"text only","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" layout which displays only text, offering a clean and minimalistic look.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Other layouts are available for this component like: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"text + icon","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"icon only","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","type":"topic","title":"Components"},"